OL,3,GNEWSAPupil who stabbed teacher in head
OL,4,Agiven four-year detention order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pupil who stabbed a teacher in the
OL,7,Fhead with a kitchen knife has been
OL,8,Fsentenced to four-and-a-half years in a
OL,9,Fyouth detention centre.
OL,11,FThe 16-year-old boy followed Vicki
OL,12,FWilliams into her empty classroom at
OL,13,FMilford Haven Comprehensive School,
OL,14,FPembrokeshire, after asking for help
OL,15,Fwith his work on 5 February.
OL,17,FThe teen pulled a knife from his bag
OL,18,Fand lunged at her, Swansea Crown Court
OL,19,Fpreviously heard, with Williams saying
OL,20,Fshe feared she would die.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
